<title>FINLAND: PSW SEES HOME PRICES RISING FURTHER.</title>
<headline>PSW SEES HOME PRICES RISING FURTHER.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish real estate dealer PSW Kiinteistomaailma Oy, part of state-owned Postipankki Oy, said on Thursday it expected the rising trend in home prices to continue.</p>
<p>&quot;The strongest rise is expected to take place in bigger flats and in semi-detached houses,&quot; PSW said in a statement, and referred to its semi-annual barometre.  </p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0248</p>
